rofile\\EnableFirewall\\value = '0' failed test of 'equals' compared to '1' \n\n---\n\nTest ID                 : oval:mil.disa.fso.windows:tst:481502 (registry_test)\nResult                  : false\nTest Title              : HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SOFTWARE\\Policies\\Microsoft\\WindowsFirewall\\PrivateProfile\\Logging!LogDroppedPackets non existent\nCheck Existence         : No collected items may exist.\nCheck                   : Result is based on check existence only.\n\nObject ID               : oval:mil.disa.fso.windows:obj:481500 (registry_object)\nObject Comment          : HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SOFTWARE\\Policies\\Microsoft\\WindowsFirewall\\PrivateProfile\\Logging!LogDroppedPackets\nObject Requirement      :  check =  'hive' must be equal to 'HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE'\nObject Requirement      :  check =  'key' must be equal to 'SOFTWARE\\Policies\\Microsoft\\WindowsFirewall\\PrivateProfile\\Logging'\nObject Requirement      :  check =  'name' must be equal to 'LogDroppedPackets'\n\nCollected Item/State Result : exists\n                        : hive equals 'HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE'\n                        : key equals 'SOFTWARE\\Policies\\Microsoft\\WindowsFirewall\\PrivateProfile\\Logging'\n                        : name equals 'LogDroppedPackets'\n                        : last_write_time equals '134330994490000000'\n                        : type equals 'reg_dword'\n                        : value equals '1'\n                        : windows_view equals '64_bit'\n\nResult Analysis         : Existence requirement is 'none_exists' and 1 collected item exists, so result is false\n\n---\n\nTest ID                 : oval:mil.disa.fso.windows:tst:481501 (registry_test)\nResult                  : false\nTest Title              : HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Services\\SharedAccess\\Parameters\\FirewallPolicy\\StandardProfile\\Logging!LogDroppedPackets value equals variable\nCheck Existence         : One or more collected items must exist.\nCheck             