olicy value for Computer Configuration &gt;&gt; Windows Settings &gt;&gt; Security Settings &gt;&gt; Windows Defender Firewall with Advanced Security &gt;&gt; Windows Defender Firewall with Advanced Security &gt;&gt; Windows Defender Firewall Properties (this link will be in the right pane) &gt;&gt; Public Profile tab &gt;&gt; Settings (select Customize) &gt;&gt; Rule merging, \"Apply local connection security rules:\" to \"No\".","security_override_guidance":"","rule_title":"Windows Defender Firewall with Advanced Security local connection rules must not be merged with Group Policy settings when connected to a public network.","potential_impacts":"","rule_id":"SV-242005r922960","group_title":"SRG-OS-000327-GPOS-00127","uuid":"4E8C42B7-6BF9-1014-97FB-BDDD4B49A78E","false_positives":"","finding_details":"Tool: cpe:/a:niwc:scc:5.14.1\nTime         : 2026-09-05T13:13:59\nResult: failRule Result             : Fail\nCriteria                : false (All child tests must be true. (AND))\nCriteria                :   true (One or more child tests must be true. (OR))\nTest                    :     true (HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SOFTWARE\\Policies\\Microsoft\\WindowsFirewall\\PublicProfile!AllowLocalIPsecPolicyMerge value equals variable)\nTest                    :     true (Registry value to determine domain membership.)\nCriteria                :   false (One or more child tests must be true. (OR))\nCriteria                :     false (All child tests must be true. (AND))\nTest                    :       false (HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SOFTWARE\\Policies\\Microsoft\\WindowsFirewall\\PublicProfile non existent)\nResult Analysis         :            Existence requirement is 'none_exists' and 1 collected item exists, so result is false\nTest                    :       true (HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Services\\SharedAccess\\Parameters\\FirewallPolicy\\PublicProfile!EnableFirewall value equals variable)\nTest                    :     false (HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SOFTWARE