t\\Services\\SharedAccess\\Parameters\\FirewallPolicy\\PublicProfile'\nObject Requirement      :  check =  'name' must be equal to 'EnableFirewall'\n\nState ID                : oval:mil.disa.fso.windows:ste:480000 (registry_state)\nState Comment           : Value equals variable\nState Requirement       : check_existence = 'at_least_one_exists',  check = all 'type' must be equal to 'reg_dword'\nState Requirement       : for allvalue, the following must be true:\nState Requirement       :     value must be equal to '1'\n\nCollected Item/State Result : true\n                        : hive equals 'HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE'\n                        : key equals 'SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Services\\SharedAccess\\Parameters\\FirewallPolicy\\PublicProfile'\n                        : name equals 'EnableFirewall'\n                        : last_write_time equals '134055519140000000'\n                        : type equals 'reg_dword'\n                        : value equals '1'\n                        : windows_view equals '64_bit'\n\n---\n\nTest ID                 : oval:mil.disa.fso.windows:tst:480000 (registry_test)\nResult                  : false\nTest Title              : HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SOFTWARE\\Policies\\Microsoft\\WindowsFirewall\\PublicProfile!EnableFirewall value equals variable\nCheck Existence         : One or more collected items must exist.\nCheck                   : All collected items must match the given state(s).\n\nObject ID               : oval:mil.disa.fso.windows:obj:480000 (registry_object)\nObject Comment          : HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SOFTWARE\\Policies\\Microsoft\\WindowsFirewall\\PublicProfile!EnableFirewall\nObject Requirement      :  check =  'hive' must be equal to 'HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE'\nObject Requirement      :  check =  'key' must be equal to 'SOFTWARE\\Policies\\Microsoft\\WindowsFirewall\\PublicProfile'\nObject Requirement      :  check =  'name' must be equal to 'EnableFirewall'\n\nState ID                : oval:mil.disa.fso.windows:ste:480